// Depot office: two storeys of brick, 16 × 10 m, the transport office below and the managers' offices above, whose
// windows look out over the yard and the docks. The front door is in the west wall, facing the yard; the stairs run up
// the east end behind a partition.
// Exterior wall segments: 0 north (x 0→16), 1 east (z 0→10), 2 south (x 16→0, at_m = 16 − x),
// 3 west (z 10→0, at_m = 10 − z).
